が多く、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"強気ながらも純情な姉と異なり、何を考えているのかつかみきれないところがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"姉妹仲はいい。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13310","sourceWorkId":"12144","spoiler":false}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8f/8fdb97a5c3c6864106e2524cb1ed94cc8cebb9707f0d9d57b86eca0293520b60.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b2/b227ebf0dcc30938b7e731ad038d7d36dd8244f917366471f0af7d8067a1a6df.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"霞 春香","creatorId":"vndb:s14","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14","name":"高野 直子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:13069","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c929","characterName":"与神 ひよ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"10938","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"3591"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13305"],"vndbCharacterId":"c929"},"originalCharacterName":"与神 ひよ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Daughter of a famous family of doctors, she is extremely polite and always speaks in the very polite desu/masu form. She always calls Sasamaru “dannasama”, and is always thinking about supporting and serving him, essentially being almost like the perfect wife. Occasionally she’ll show her more stern side, primarily to Harutsuge as punishment for jokes going too far."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Agilis' review."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her name from previous life is Kikuyo (菊世)"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c929"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"『四君子』の“菊”にして、医学界の重鎮である与神家の令嬢。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"名家にして資産家という家庭環境、優雅で理知的なふるまい、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"才能に恵まれ万事そつなくこなす天才肌だが決して努力を怠ることはない──という、非の打ち所のない完璧娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特に知性を感じさせる言動からも察する事ができる通り非常に知能が高く、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃から医学者たちに囲まれて育ったせいか、医療面に関する知識も豊富。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし彼女自身の性質としては、医師というよりも看護師的な面が強い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公とは兄妹のような関係だが、それと共に彼を\"患者\"と捉えている節があり、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その介護こそが自分の役目だと思い込んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『四君子』と別れることになってしまった主人公とは、ずっと手紙のやり取りが続いていた。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13305","sourceWorkId":"12144","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"『四君子』之“菊”，名震医学界的与神家的千金。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"出身名家，资产家的家庭环境，优雅理智的行为举止，天赋异禀，无所不能的天才，但绝不会疏于努力——这样的一个无可挑剔的完美少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"与她那能够令人感知到知性的言行中察觉到的一样，智能特别高，因为从小时候开始就成长于被医学者围绕的环境的关系么，在医疗方面的知识也很丰富。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"然而就她本身的性格来讲，与其说是医师，不如说护士的方面更强一些。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"与同属『赤组』的笹丸的关系仿佛兄妹一般，但因为有着认定他是“患者”的一节，深信照顾他才是自己的使命。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"与和『四君子』分别的笹丸一直保持着书信联系。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10938"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7f/7f5c4f703b50a28d62f9b7df8d8de91c3e901c6e79c4eb14b84e35f793901dca.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/42/42605098c26dc915c845feca1e30e9bb1f8935468440c667a678088fcd588b9d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"友永朱音","creatorId":"vndb:s83","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s83","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s83","name":"友永 朱音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:3591:10938:4432:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c938","characterName":"夢乃 蘭","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"10939","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"3591"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13306"],"vndbCharacterId":"c938"},"originalCharacterName":"夢乃 蘭","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Bright, cheery, sunny girl with the name that’s an obscure reading of the more common “Ran” for orchid. Generally she’s the moodmaker of the group, often serving as the Tsukkomi to Harutsuge’s Boke, and spraying sunshine everywhere. The only problem is that she has this weird obsession with doing things a certain way, the same way that old men do things… so most people in the game occasionally describe her “ossan”. She hates being called that, but there’s no stopping the truth."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Agilis' review."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c938"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"『四君子』の“蘭”にして、主人公の一つ年下の『赤組』。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"例え何かで落ち込み、下を向いて歩くような事があろうと──彼女が傍にいるだけで自然と上を向いて歩ける元気をくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るくも朗らかな性格のムードメーカー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小さな身体ですべてを包み込む聖母のような度量と愛情に溢れた彼女だが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"時折、妙ちくりんなルールを持ち出しては周囲を混乱させる──その名を通称『アララギルール』。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"別名『頭取の教え』。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"それは彼女が恩人として慕う存在の教えから成るものなのだが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どこでどう曲解したのか、彼女が取っている行動はどこからどう見ても「おっさん」である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、「おっさん」と言われると怒る。でもおっさん。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13306","sourceWorkId":"12144","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"『四君子』之“兰”，比笹丸小一岁的『赤组』。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"即使因为某些事而意志消沉，垂头丧气—只要有她在身边，就会自然地精神一振，重拾生机的性格开朗乐观的气氛制造家。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"凭着小小的身体包容一切，满溢着圣母一般的度量与爱情的她，偶尔也会提出些异想天开的规则混乱周围人思维——通称其名为『兰之规约』。别名『老板的教诲』。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽然这源出于她作为恩人仰慕着的存在的教诲，但不知道是在哪个环节上误解了，她所采取的行动不管怎么看都是个「大叔」。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不过被说是「大叔」就会恼羞成怒。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不过果然还是大叔。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10939"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cb/cbef8e15fb7b5f40bcbad35ccf802903426fe9bcd475079701d595499bf8b786.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/76/7643347bfa397f9da6de693a565b9cad725d8181bb04d168474e105204202106.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高田初美","creatorId":"vndb:s363","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s363","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s363","name":"高田 初美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:3591:10939:5052:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c947","characterName":"セクハラ大王","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"10940","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"3591"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13307"],"vndbCharacterId":"c947"},"originalCharacterName":"セクハラ大王","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The 1 year older “big sis” type character of the group. But not in the kind Onee-san sort of way, more in a joking kind of way that’s closer to being the “Best friend” character in other games. The one who’s usually male and makes all sorts of off-color jokes."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Agilis' review."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She is Sasa real older sister but exiled from Shu family at 4 years old because she is a girl"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c947"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"『四君子』の“梅”にして、主人公の一つ年上の『赤組』。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも背筋を真っ直ぐに伸ばした、堅物のお姉さん──という印象を受けるが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「この学園で平穏に生きていきたかったら逆らってはならない」上位の存在。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ひよ曰く、「わたくしが入学した時には、すでに学園のボスとして君臨していた」とのこと。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、その正体はエロ大王。突拍子もなく下ネタを振っては、周囲を混乱させている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特にひよに関しては並々ならぬ思い入れがあるようで、わざと怒らせるような言動を取ってはひよに責められ、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その度に恍惚とした表情を浮かべているという、複雑な性癖を持つ変態である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"またアララギとは大の仲良しで、いつも二人一緒にいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公たちにとっては、良きお姉さんとしての位置づけだった。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13307","sourceWorkId":"12144","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"『四君子』之“梅”，比笹丸大一岁的『赤组』。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"总是挺直背脊，严谨顽固的御姐——虽然给人这样的印象、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"也是作为「想在这个学园里平安无事地生存下去的话绝不能反抗的存在」被畏惧的大姐头。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"按ひよ的说法，「我入学的时候，已经作为学园BOSS君临天下了」。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"从小时候开始，并没做啥特别的事，就被擅自定位成大姐头，本人已经习以为常了。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"其真实身份是工口大王。会没头没脑地说些下流段子，令周围人一片混乱。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特别对ひよ，貌似有着非同寻常的执念，会故意采取惹怒她的言行，每次被她斥责时都会浮现出恍惚的表情，是个拥有复杂性癖的变态。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"此外与兰关系非常好，二人一直在一起。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10940"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bd/bd050738cf2b7cb9f6b376a97291e0e193b04cbd41c92dc1c873abe7e582e149.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e9/e9ce2f64772813a36fd2c5809cada2061e8c4f5eb5b55a22b2f04b8de56dbb0d.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"生天目仁美","creatorId":"vndb:s270","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s270","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s270","name":"生天目仁美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:3591:10940:4394:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c948","characterName":"若","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"10943","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"3591"}],"egsCharacterIds":["13308"],"vndbCharacterId":"c948"},"originalCharacterName":"若","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mysterious girl that works for the student council. She loves milk tea, a lot. She even has a song about it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Agilis' review."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her real name is Tsune Wakamaru (経若丸), daughter of Kureha (Momiji) and granddaughter of Sasamaru and Kikuyo"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c948"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"“生徒会長の使い”として主人公の前に姿を表した、不思議な雰囲気を持つ少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生徒会としての役割をこなす彼女の印象は「冷たい」「事務的」といったものだが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「お姉さま」と慕うひよに対する姿は、また印象が異なる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その反面、とにかく主人公を嫌っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どことなく爺臭く感じられる彼を「じじぃ」と呼び、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そしてひよに慕われる彼を激しく攻撃対象としてロックオン。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"どこからともなく包丁を取り出す日々。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ミルクティーをみるくちーと呼ぶこだわり、大事にしよう」とわけのわからないことを言い出す、ミルクティー大好きっ娘。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"13308","sourceWorkId":"12144","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"在梦见鸟学园，各个班级被分成赤、青、黄等色。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"正因为如此，凭借『透明』而维持中立的学生自治组织――"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"作为其使者出现在笹丸面前的拥有不可思议氛围的少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽然负责完成这个任务的她给人的印象是「冷淡」「事务」，但面对仰慕为「姐姐」的ひよ的姿态，又给人不同的印象。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"作为反面，总之非常讨厌ひよ示以好意的笹丸，称呼总让人感觉有点老气横秋的他为「老头」，作为激烈的攻击对象锁定。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"不知从何处取出菜刀的那段日日夜夜。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"说着「要好好珍惜称奶茶为みるくちー的讲究啊」之类莫名其妙的话，超喜欢奶茶的少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「好了下面是提问时间。遭遇生不如死的痛苦折磨之后被杀，与平安无事地度过余生，是选择前者吧？」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"mask本名：経若丸（つねわかまる）/mask"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"10943"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/10/10d6aa7ef9b7d658089459be9ba7ca02794af4c91d496f14da6d17593fa6d74a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0f/0f93895e6431f58f8218d655476f4fa482a0e02c8d0a4b8f2c61a9fbc371d64b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-de